Description: System tray indicator and window for the kcd KDE Connect daemon
 Shows the phone's battery and connection state in the system tray, with
 actions to browse files, send the clipboard or files, ring, ping and control
 media. Left-click opens a GTK 4 window with the device overview, SMS
 conversations and recent notifications with inline replies.
